# Adding Target Tracking Features to QML PPI Radar

I'll implement the requested features for your Qt QML 6.8.2 application. This implementation will add target tracking to a radar PPI (Plan Position Indicator) display.

## Main.qml

```qml
import QtQuick
import QtQuick.Controls
import QtQuick.Layouts
import QtPositioning

ApplicationWindow {
    id: root
    visible: true
    width: 1024
    height: 768
    title: "Radar PPI with Target Tracking"

    property var selectedTarget: null
    property var trackedTarget: null

    // Dummy target data - would normally come from a C++ backend
    ListModel {
        id: targetModel

        Component.onCompleted: {
            // Add some initial dummy targets
            append({ 
                targetId: "T001", 
                latitude: 51.5074, 
                longitude: -0.1278, 
                altitude: 1500, 
                speed: 320, 
                heading: 45, 
                situation: "friendly" 
            })
            append({ 
                targetId: "T002", 
                latitude: 51.5172, 
                longitude: -0.1356, 
                altitude: 2500, 
                speed: 280, 
                heading: 135, 
                situation: "unknown" 
            })
            append({ 
                targetId: "T003", 
                latitude: 51.4972, 
                longitude: -0.1156, 
                altitude: 1200, 
                speed: 450, 
                heading: 270, 
                situation: "hostile" 
            })
            append({ 
                targetId: "T004", 
                latitude: 51.5272, 
                longitude: -0.1456, 
                altitude: 3000, 
                speed: 150, 
                heading: 315, 
                situation: "friendly" 
            })
            append({ 
                targetId: "T005", 
                latitude: 51.4872, 
                longitude: -0.1056, 
                altitude: 5000, 
                speed: 500, 
                heading: 180, 
                situation: "neutral" 
            })
        }
    }

    // Main layout
    ColumnLayout {
        anchors.fill: parent
        spacing: 10

        // Radar PPI display
        RadarPPI {
            id: radarPPI
            Layout.fillWidth: true
            Layout.fillHeight: true
            Layout.margins: 10
            targetModel: targetModel
            selectedTarget: root.selectedTarget
            trackedTarget: root.trackedTarget

            onTargetClicked: function(targetData) {
                root.selectedTarget = targetData
            }

            onTargetDoubleClicked: function(targetData) {
                if (root.trackedTarget && root.trackedTarget.targetId === targetData.targetId) {
                    // Untrack if double-clicking already tracked target
                    root.trackedTarget = null
                } else {
                    // Track the new target
                    root.trackedTarget = targetData
                }
            }
        }

        // Target information panel
        TargetInfoPanel {
            id: infoPanel
            Layout.fillWidth: true
            Layout.preferredHeight: 150
            Layout.margins: 10
            targetData: root.selectedTarget
            visible: root.selectedTarget !== null
        }
    }
}
```

## RadarPPI.qml

```qml
import QtQuick
import QtQuick.Controls
import QtPositioning

Rectangle {
    id: radarDisplay
    color: "#001a2d"
    radius: width / 2
    border.color: "#003366"
    border.width: 2

    property var targetModel
    property var selectedTarget: null
    property var trackedTarget: null
    property real range: 100 // Nautical miles
    property var centerPosition: QtPositioning.coordinate(51.5074, -0.1278) // London as center

    // Signals for target interaction
    signal targetClicked(var targetData)
    signal targetDoubleClicked(var targetData)

    // Radar sweep animation
    Item {
        id: radarSweep
        anchors.fill: parent

        Rectangle {
            id: sweepLine
            width: Math.max(radarDisplay.width, radarDisplay.height)
            height: 2
            color: "#00ff00"
            opacity: 0.7
            transformOrigin: Item.Left
            x: radarDisplay.width / 2
            y: radarDisplay.height / 2

            RotationAnimation {
                target: sweepLine
                property: "rotation"
                from: 0
                to: 360
                duration: 4000
                loops: Animation.Infinite
                running: true
            }

            Rectangle {
                width: sweepLine.width
                height: sweepLine.height
                gradient: Gradient {
                    GradientStop { position: 0.0; color: "#00ff00" }
                    GradientStop { position: 0.5; color: "transparent" }
                }
            }
        }
    }

    // Radar range rings
    Canvas {
        id: rangeRings
        anchors.fill: parent

        onPaint: {
            var ctx = getContext("2d");
            ctx.reset();

            var centerX = width / 2;
            var centerY = height / 2;
            var radius = width / 2;

            // Draw range rings at 25%, 50%, 75% of max range
            ctx.strokeStyle = "#003366";
            ctx.lineWidth = 1;

            for (var i = 1; i <= 4; i++) {
                var ringRadius = radius * (i / 4);
                ctx.beginPath();
                ctx.arc(centerX, centerY, ringRadius, 0, Math.PI * 2);
                ctx.stroke();

                // Add range labels
                ctx.fillStyle = "#00ff00";
                ctx.font = "10px Arial";
                ctx.textAlign = "center";
                ctx.fillText((i * 25) + " nm", centerX, centerY - ringRadius - 5);
            }

            // Draw cardinal direction lines
            ctx.beginPath();
            ctx.moveTo(centerX, centerY - radius);
            ctx.lineTo(centerX, centerY + radius);
            ctx.moveTo(centerX - radius, centerY);
            ctx.lineTo(centerX + radius, centerY);
            ctx.stroke();

            // Add cardinal direction labels
            ctx.fillText("N", centerX, 15);
            ctx.fillText("S", centerX, height - 5);
            ctx.fillText("W", 15, centerY);
            ctx.fillText("E", width - 15, centerY);
        }
    }

    // Targets display
    Repeater {
        model: targetModel

        delegate: TargetIndicator {
            centerX: radarDisplay.width / 2
            centerY: radarDisplay.height / 2
            maxRange: radarDisplay.range
            targetData: {
                const data = {
                    targetId: model.targetId,
                    latitude: model.latitude,
                    longitude: model.longitude,
                    altitude: model.altitude,
                    speed: model.speed,
                    heading: model.heading,
                    situation: model.situation
                };

                // Calculate distance and bearing from center
                const targetCoord = QtPositioning.coordinate(model.latitude, model.longitude);
                const distance = centerPosition.distanceTo(targetCoord) / 1852; // Convert to nautical miles
                const azimuth = centerPosition.azimuthTo(targetCoord);

                data.distance = distance;
                data.azimuth = azimuth;

                return data;
            }

            isSelected: selectedTarget && selectedTarget.targetId === model.targetId
            isTracked: trackedTarget && trackedTarget.targetId === model.targetId

            onClicked: radarDisplay.targetClicked(targetData)
            onDoubleClicked: radarDisplay.targetDoubleClicked(targetData)
        }
    }
}
```

## TargetIndicator.qml

```qml
import QtQuick

Item {
    id: targetIndicator

    property real centerX: 0
    property real centerY: 0
    property real maxRange: 100 // nm
    property var targetData
    property bool isSelected: false
    property bool isTracked: false

    signal clicked(var targetData)
    signal doubleClicked(var targetData)

    // Calculate position on radar display
    x: calculateX()
    y: calculateY()
    width: 20
    height: 20
    visible: targetData.distance <= maxRange

    function calculateX() {
        // Convert azimuth (bearing) to radians and adjust for coordinate system
        const angle = (90 - targetData.azimuth) * Math.PI / 180;
        const distance = targetData.distance / maxRange; // Normalize to 0-1 range
        return centerX + Math.cos(angle) * distance * (centerX - 10);
    }

    function calculateY() {
        // Convert azimuth (bearing) to radians and adjust for coordinate system
        const angle = (90 - targetData.azimuth) * Math.PI / 180;
        const distance = targetData.distance / maxRange; // Normalize to 0-1 range
        return centerY - Math.sin(angle) * distance * (centerY - 10);
    }

    // Target symbol
    Canvas {
        id: targetSymbol
        anchors.centerIn: parent
        width: 16
        height: 16

        onPaint: {
            const ctx = getContext("2d");
            ctx.reset();

            // Style based on situation and status
            let symbolColor;
            switch (targetData.situation) {
                case "friendly":
                    symbolColor = "#00ff00"; // Green
                    break;
                case "hostile":
                    symbolColor = "#ff0000"; // Red
                    break;
                case "neutral":
                    symbolColor = "#ffff00"; // Yellow
                    break;
                case "unknown":
                default:
                    symbolColor = "#ffffff"; // White
            }

            if (isSelected) {
                ctx.lineWidth = 2;
            } else {
                ctx.lineWidth = 1;
            }

            // Draw different shapes based on tracked status
            if (isTracked) {
                // Diamond for tracked targets
                ctx.strokeStyle = symbolColor;
                ctx.fillStyle = "rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3)";
                ctx.beginPath();
                ctx.moveTo(width/2, 0);
                ctx.lineTo(width, height/2);
                ctx.lineTo(width/2, height);
                ctx.lineTo(0, height/2);
                ctx.closePath();
                ctx.fill();
                ctx.stroke();

                // Add direction vector
                const angle = targetData.heading * Math.PI / 180;
                ctx.beginPath();
                ctx.moveTo(width/2, height/2);
                ctx.lineTo(
                    width/2 + Math.sin(angle) * 12,
                    height/2 - Math.cos(angle) * 12
                );
                ctx.stroke();
            } else {
                // Circle for regular targets
                ctx.strokeStyle = symbolColor;
                ctx.beginPath();
                ctx.arc(width/2, height/2, 5, 0, Math.PI * 2);
                ctx.stroke();
            }

            // Add target ID for tracked targets
            if (isTracked || isSelected) {
                ctx.fillStyle = symbolColor;
                ctx.font = "8px Arial";
                ctx.fillText(targetData.targetId, -10, height + 10);
            }
        }
    }

    // Handle interaction
    MouseArea {
        anchors.fill: parent
        anchors.margins: -5 // Increase clickable area

        onClicked: targetIndicator.clicked(targetData)
        onDoubleClicked: targetIndicator.doubleClicked(targetData)

        // Tooltip with basic info
        hoverEnabled: true

        ToolTip {
            visible: parent.containsMouse
            text: targetData.targetId + " • " + Math.round(targetData.distance) + " nm"
            delay: 500
        }
    }
}
```

## TargetInfoPanel.qml

```qml
import QtQuick
import QtQuick.Controls
import QtQuick.Layouts

Rectangle {
    id: infoPanel

    property var targetData: null

    color: "#0a1a2d"
    border.color: "#003366"
    border.width: 1
    radius: 5

    ColumnLayout {
        anchors.fill: parent
        anchors.margins: 10
        spacing: 10

        Label {
            id: titleLabel
            text: targetData ? "Target " + targetData.targetId + " Details" : "No Target Selected"
            font.bold: true
            font.pixelSize: 16
            color: "#00ff00"
            Layout.fillWidth: true
        }

        GridLayout {
            columns: 4
            columnSpacing: 20
            rowSpacing: 5
            Layout.fillWidth: true
            visible: targetData !== null

            // Headers
            Label { 
                text: "Position" 
                font.bold: true 
                color: "#00ff00"
                Layout.columnSpan: 2
            }
            Label { 
                text: "Motion" 
                font.bold: true 
                color: "#00ff00" 
                Layout.columnSpan: 2
            }

            // Position data
            Label { text: "Distance:" ; color: "#ffffff" }
            Label { 
                text: targetData ? Math.round(targetData.distance * 10) / 10 + " nm" : "" 
                color: "#00ff00"
            }

            Label { text: "Speed:"; color: "#ffffff" }
            Label { 
                text: targetData ? targetData.speed + " kts" : ""
                color: "#00ff00"
            }

            Label { text: "Bearing:"; color: "#ffffff" }
            Label { 
                text: targetData ? Math.round(targetData.azimuth) + "°" : ""
                color: "#00ff00"
            }

            Label { text: "Heading:"; color: "#ffffff" }
            Label { 
                text: targetData ? targetData.heading + "°" : ""
                color: "#00ff00" 
            }

            Label { text: "Lat/Long:"; color: "#ffffff" }
            Label { 
                text: targetData ? 
                    targetData.latitude.toFixed(4) + ", " + targetData.longitude.toFixed(4) : ""
                color: "#00ff00"
            }

            Label { text: "Altitude:"; color: "#ffffff" }
            Label { 
                text: targetData ? targetData.altitude + " ft" : ""
                color: "#00ff00"
            }

            Label { text: "Status:"; color: "#ffffff" }
            Label { 
                text: targetData ? targetData.situation.charAt(0).toUpperCase() + targetData.situation.slice(1) : ""
                color: getStatusColor()
                font.bold: true
            }

            Item { Layout.fillWidth: true }
            Item { Layout.fillWidth: true }
        }

        Item { Layout.fillHeight: true }

        RowLayout {
            Layout.fillWidth: true

            Button {
                text: "Track Target"
                enabled: targetData !== null
                highlighted: parent.parent.parent.parent.trackedTarget && 
                            parent.parent.parent.parent.trackedTarget.targetId === targetData.targetId
                onClicked: {
                    if (parent.parent.parent.parent.trackedTarget && 
                        parent.parent.parent.parent.trackedTarget.targetId === targetData.targetId) {
                        // Untrack
                        parent.parent.parent.parent.trackedTarget = null;
                    } else {
                        // Track
                        parent.parent.parent.parent.trackedTarget = targetData;
                    }
                }
            }

            Item { Layout.fillWidth: true }

            Button {
                text: "Close"
                onClicked: {
                    parent.parent.parent.parent.selectedTarget = null;
                }
            }
        }
    }

    function getStatusColor() {
        if (!targetData) return "#ffffff";

        switch (targetData.situation) {
            case "friendly": return "#00ff00";
            case "hostile": return "#ff0000";
            case "neutral": return "#ffff00";
            case "unknown":
            default: return "#ffffff";
        }
    }
}
```

## Explanation

This implementation provides:

1. **Dummy Targets**: A ListModel with target data including latitude, longitude, altitude, speed, heading, and situation status.

2. **PPI Display**: A radar-like Plan Position Indicator that shows targets at the appropriate bearing and range from the center.

3. **Target Selection**: Clicking on a target selects it and displays its information in the info panel.

4. **Target Tracking**: Double-clicking a target toggles tracking status, which changes the visual appearance of the target on the radar.

5. **Target Visualization**: Different visual styles for selected and tracked targets, with color coding based on their situation (friendly, hostile, etc).

The code follows best practices:
- Clear component separation
- Props and signals for communication between components
- Proper sizing and layout management
- Visually appealing radar appearance
- Efficient rendering with Canvas
- Appropriate data calculations for positioning targets
- Context-sensitive styling and tooltips

This implementation should work with Qt 6.8.2 QML. You may need to adjust some details to match your specific application structure, and you'd typically connect to real data sources rather than the dummy targets included here.
